[131.247268, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[131.295809, "o", "bob sends a message (first-draft). Which runtime session does it land in?\r\n\r\n  the browser sent session ID   alice-conversation-0001-0001-0001-0001\r\n  this backend takes it from    request  (whatever the browser says)\r\n  runtimeSessionId used         alice-conversation-0001-0001-0001-0001   (38 characters; AWS asks for at least 33)\r\n\r\n  InvokeAgentRuntime(agentRuntimeArn, runtimeSessionId, payload)\r\n  same runtimeSessionId  -> the same microVM: its memory, its files, the earlier conversation\r\n  new runtimeSessionId   -> a new microVM; after the session it is stopped and its memory sanitized\r\n  stops after 900 s idle and 28800 s at most (AWS defaults: 15 minutes, 8 hours)\r\n\r\n=> AgentCore does not check that this session belongs to this user. Your backend must.\r\n"]
[131.303859, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u001b[00m$ "]
