[157.318967, "o", "l"]
[157.443978, "o", "i"]
[157.564817, "o", "c"]
[157.69215, "o", "e"]
[158.152863, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[158.201689, "o", "bob is signed in and asks for their tickets (hardened). The agent needs a token for tickets-saas.\r\n\r\n  1. runtime inbound: JWT. AgentCore validated the token, took iss and sub\r\n  2. GetWorkloadAccessTokenForJWT -> a workload access token for (agent, user) = (tsg_helpdesk-AbCdEf1234, bob)\r\n     the browser also said user = alice: ignored, the user comes from the token\r\n  3. GetResourceOauth2Token(tickets-saas, USER_FEDERATION) with that workload access token\r\n  4. the vault returns the token stored for user bob: tickets-token-for-bob\r\n\r\n=> the agent reads bob's tickets\r\n"]
[158.209039, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u001b[00m$ "]
