[187.892446, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[187.942215, "o", "One tools/call through the gateway (hardened), as the policy engine sees it:\r\n\r\n  principal  AgentCore::OAuthUser::\"sub-bob\"   tags = the token's claims (username = bob)\r\n  action     AgentCore::Action::\"HelpdeskTools___reset_mfa\"\r\n  resource   AgentCore::Gateway::\"...helpdesk-gw-a1b2c3d4e5\"\r\n  context    input = {\"target_username\": \"ceo\", \"caller_username\": \"bob\"}   (the tool arguments, written by the model)\r\n\r\n  forbid caller_must_be_signed_in_user  does not apply\r\n  forbid never_reset_breakglass         does not apply\r\n  permit read_tools                     does not apply\r\n  permit reset_mfa_it_staff             does not apply\r\n"]
[187.942425, "o", "  permit reset_own_mfa                  does not apply\r\n  permit send_email                     does not apply\r\n\r\n  decision   DENY   (No policy applies to the request (denied by default).)\r\n  mode       ENFORCE  -> the call is REFUSED\r\n"]
[187.949991, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u001b[00m$ "]
