[241.017203, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[241.06685, "o", "bob says \"Remember that I prefer updates by email.\" (first-draft)\r\n\r\n  short-term: CreateEvent(actorId = alice, sessionId = ...)   the raw turn, kept 30 days\r\n  actorId comes from the request; the browser said alice\r\n  long-term:  semanticMemoryStrategy 'helpdesk_facts' extracts a fact, saved under /helpdesk/facts/\r\n              for actorId alice: /helpdesk/facts/\r\n              for alice, bob and priya alike: /helpdesk/facts/   <- one shared shelf\r\n\r\n  Later, RetrieveMemoryRecords on that namespace brings these facts back into the agent's prompt.\r\n"]
[241.074901, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u001b[00m$ "]
