[252.281325, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[252.330897, "o", "bob says \"Remember that I prefer updates by email.\" (hardened)\r\n\r\n  short-term: CreateEvent(actorId = bob, sessionId = ...)   the raw turn, kept 30 days\r\n  actorId comes from the token\r\n  long-term:  semanticMemoryStrategy 'helpdesk_facts' extracts a fact, saved under /users/{actorId}/facts/\r\n              for actorId bob: /users/bob/facts/\r\n              alice, bob, priya: /users/alice/facts/, /users/bob/facts/, /users/priya/facts/   <- one shelf each\r\n\r\n  Later, RetrieveMemoryRecords on that namespace brings these facts back into the agent's prompt.\r\n"]
