[262.347978, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[262.396433, "o", "What this setup records (first-draft)\r\n\r\n  CloudTrail selector 'management only': Management\r\n  tracing (spans)         runtime   (Transaction Search off)\r\n  log delivery            none\r\n  online evaluation       none\r\n\r\nOne gateway span from data/incident/spans.jsonl (illustrative values, AWS's attribute names):\r\n  AuthorizeAction  2027-01-14T09:09:31Z\r\n    aws.agentcore.policy.authorization_decision      \"DENY\"\r\n"]
[262.396642, "o", "    aws.agentcore.policy.determining_policies        []\r\n    aws.agentcore.gateway.policy.mode                \"LOG_ONLY\"\r\n    lab.tool / lab.principal (lab additions)         HelpdeskTools___reset_mfa / sub-bob\r\n"]
[262.404282, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;thesecguy@lab: ~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u0007\u001b[01;32mthesecguy@lab\u001b[00m:\u001b[01;34m~/ai-security-course-labs/labs/m14\u001b[00m$ "]
