[272.241652, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[272.292448, "o", "What this setup records (hardened)\r\n\r\n  CloudTrail selector 'management': Management\r\n  CloudTrail selector 'agentcore data events': Data events on Runtime, Gateway, Memory, TokenVault, WorkloadIdentity\r\n  tracing (spans)         runtime, gateway, memory   (Transaction Search on)\r\n  log delivery            gateway APPLICATION_LOGS, memory APPLICATION_LOGS\r\n  online evaluation       built-in Correctness, Helpfulness, Harmfulness, Refusal, ToolParameterAccuracy\r\n"]
[272.292649, "o", "\r\nOne gateway span from data/incident/spans.jsonl (illustrative values, AWS's attribute names):\r\n  AuthorizeAction  2027-01-14T09:09:31Z\r\n    aws.agentcore.policy.authorization_decision      \"DENY\"\r\n    aws.agentcore.policy.determining_policies        []\r\n    aws.agentcore.gateway.policy.mode                \"LOG_ONLY\"\r\n    lab.tool / lab.principal (lab additions)         HelpdeskTools___reset_mfa / sub-bob\r\n"]
